{"dataItems":[{"id":"4a06a277-afea-462d-a59d-6830d3e6df2e","dataCollectionId":"teambios","data":{"biography":"Rev. Dr. Victor Pillay was born in 1957 in Overport, Durban, into a family with roots in Chennai, Tamil Nadu, and was raised in the Hindu faith. As a child he attended a Sunday School and, through the faithful teaching he received, the gospel became clear to him. At the age of 20, at a youth camp, he made a real commitment to Christ and was baptised, becoming the only Christian in his family at the time. Years of faithful prayer followed, and in time his entire family came to know the Lord, including his father, who gave his heart to Christ at the age of 66.

Sensing a clear call to ministry, Dr Pillay began his theological studies in 1989 at the University of KwaZulu-Natal, earning his BTh (Hons) and MTh degrees while serving the Reformed Church in Africa's Emmanuel congregation in Durban for 27 years. He also served as First Clerk of the international executive of the Reformed Ecumenical Synod, ministering in many countries around the world.

He went on to complete his PhD in Missiology at the University of Pretoria while serving as Reverend of RCA Charisma in Laudium, Pretoria, from 2007 to the present, with the constant support of his wife and two sons. Since 2021, he has also served as a Senior Lecturer at Mukhanyo Theological College, having taught there part-time for several years before that. Trusting the Lord to keep his family and himself in the centre of His mission and ministry, Dr Pillay continues to serve faithfully today.","role":"Reverend","leaderName":"Dr. Rev. Victor Pillay","_id":"4a06a277-afea-462d-a59d-6830d3e6df2e","_owner":"dd740b77-12e6-4c11-a12c-c2edd5f7d603","_createdDate":{"$date":"2026-09-16T18:38:14.645Z"},"ministry":"","profilePhoto":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/dd740b_50ab780f631d42a6a8dc26acfb04b2a0~mv2.jpg","_updatedDate":{"$date":"2026-09-16T18:44:46.662Z"}}},{"id":"9e94363f-58f5-4398-8d79-02486fb3d149","dataCollectionId":"teambios","data":{"biography":"","role":"Elder","leaderName":"Shaylin Pillay","_id":"9e94363f-58f5-4398-8d79-02486fb3d149","_owner":"dd740b77-12e6-4c11-a12c-c2edd5f7d603","_createdDate":{"$date":"2026-09-16T18:38:14.644Z"},"profilePhoto":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/dd740b_c8f26e93ebbf45299a1781dde1d32144~mv2.jpg","_updatedDate":{"$date":"2026-09-29T05:45:11.636Z"}}},{"id":"b5cdd8ce-1474-45af-9614-cef4d8d2afc3","dataCollectionId":"teambios","data":{"biography":"","role":"Elder","leaderName":"Romulen Pillay","_id":"b5cdd8ce-1474-45af-9614-cef4d8d2afc3","_owner":"dd740b77-12e6-4c11-a12c-c2edd5f7d603","_createdDate":{"$date":"2026-09-16T18:38:14.643Z"},"profilePhoto":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/dd740b_36752a5996e04b4b9dd2c5b6a4cc3294~mv2.jpg","_updatedDate":{"$date":"2026-09-29T05:45:11.707Z"}}},{"id":"6fd9055b-9d01-4070-a005-0e2928014146","dataCollectionId":"teambios","data":{"biography":"","role":"Elder","leaderName":"Ricky Moodley","_id":"6fd9055b-9d01-4070-a005-0e2928014146","_owner":"dd740b77-12e6-4c11-a12c-c2edd5f7d603","_created